---
import Marketing from "../layouts/Marketing.astro";
import InstallJourney from "../components/InstallJourney.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";

const archives = [
  { platform: "Linux AMD64", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz", sha256: "40ecd97e8bb1cab931b718b78be5bdc6cd26e6021a5ef1a1d275f4ca98cf1da9", experimental: false },
  { platform: "Linux ARM64", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-linux-arm64.tar.gz", sha256: "4fe8798dde81b013edbae659b38865ce5bfbc8de3f761e15b0ffad58aed8fd49", experimental: false },
  { platform: "macOS Intel", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-macos-amd64.tar.gz", sha256: "6900504350b5ee9848729b3371a11af00d5a9733d68c39635322006c14be1f1c", experimental: false },
  { platform: "macOS Apple Silicon", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-macos-arm64.tar.gz", sha256: "459d2044f28d076f167ead1e58077027b207f1a4bda2112caf235614c52ecdc4", experimental: false },
  { platform: "Windows AMD64", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-windows-amd64.zip", sha256: "526f0c19594112446a0d8c6d531216501a0ad81d55b26fb7e93ac80d228dd907", experimental: false },
  { platform: "Windows ARM64", file: "goshikq-1.0.0-windows-arm64.zip", sha256: "4107cd9ef42a3f5fb51bd86a09ccba4cbde157c8f60c4858cb695f23123814ea", experimental: true },
];
---
<Marketing title="Install Goshikq v1.0.0" description="Download the Goshikq v1.0.0 GitHub Release or install the Python and TypeScript SDKs from source." path="/download/">
  <section class="hero wrap prose">
    <p class="kicker">Install</p>
    <h1>Install Goshikq v1.0.0</h1>
    <p class="lede"><strong>This is the stable GitHub Release <a href={SITE.githubPrerelease}><code>v1.0.0</code></a>.</strong> <code>v1.0.0-rc.1</code> is superseded because it shipped <code>jsonwebtoken</code> 9.3.1 (GHSA-h395-gr6q-cpjc / CVE-2026-25537). <code>v1.0.0-rc.2</code> remains published. There is no PyPI, npm, or crates.io package. Python <code>{SITE.pythonPackage}=={SITE.pythonVersion}</code> and TypeScript <code>{SITE.tsPackage}@{SITE.tsVersion}</code> install from source.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={SITE.githubPrerelease}>Open the GitHub release</a></p>
    <h2>Install, then run an agent</h2>
    <p>Choose one tab. Operating-system tabs install the v1.0.0 runtime. Language tabs install an SDK that talks to that runtime. Registry commands are omitted because those packages are not published. The switch that turns them on is <a href={`${SITE.github}/blob/main/docs/release/v1.0.1-publication-switch.md`}>the publication checklist</a>.</p>
    <InstallJourney />
    <h2>Native archives</h2>
    <p>Binaries were built from commit <code>83bc8e71edf46a20986f2380309e3d74d0ff3ab9</code>. After download, verify:</p>
    <pre class="install"><code>sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS</code></pre>
    <p><a href={`${SITE.githubPrereleaseAssets}/SHA256SUMS`}>SHA256SUMS</a> · <a href={`${SITE.githubPrereleaseAssets}/goshikq-1.0.0.spdx.json`}>SPDX SBOM</a> · <a href={`${SITE.githubPrereleaseAssets}/license-inventory.md`}>License inventory</a> · <a href={`${SITE.githubPrereleaseAssets}/artifact-manifest.json`}>Provenance manifest</a> · <a href={SITE.githubPrerelease}>Release notes</a></p>
    <p>Per-platform provenance files on the same release are named <code>provenance-linux-amd64.json</code>, <code>provenance-linux-arm64.json</code>, <code>provenance-macos-amd64.json</code>, <code>provenance-macos-arm64.json</code>, <code>provenance-windows-amd64.json</code>, and <code>provenance-windows-arm64.json</code>.</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Platform</th><th>Archive</th><th>SHA256</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {archives.map((a) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{a.platform}{a.experimental ? " (experimental)" : ""}</td>
            <td><a href={`${SITE.githubPrereleaseAssets}/${a.file}`}>{a.file}</a></td>
            <td><code>{a.sha256}</code></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><strong>Windows ARM64 is experimental</strong> and is not a required v1.0 platform. Prefer Windows AMD64, Linux, or macOS. Production must use a real <code>DATABASE_URL</code> and must not use <code>GOSHIKQ_AUTH_MODE=none</code>.</p>
    <h2>Source</h2>
    <pre class="install"><code>git clone {SITE.githubGit}</code></pre>
    <p><a href={SITE.github}>Open the repository</a></p>
    <h2>Development snapshot ZIP</h2>
    <p>This is the <code>main</code> branch. The immutable release tag is <code>v1.0.0</code>.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href={SITE.zipMain}>Download main.zip</a></p>
    <h2>Python</h2>
    <p>Package name <code>{SITE.pythonPackage}</code> version <code>{SITE.pythonVersion}</code> is built locally. It is not on PyPI.</p>
    <pre class="install"><code>python -m pip install -e sdk/python
# extras (experimental providers): pip install -e "sdk/python[openai]" </code></pre>
    <h2>TypeScript / Bun</h2>
    <p><code>{SITE.tsPackage}@{SITE.tsVersion}</code> is not on npm. From the repo root:</p>
    <pre class="install"><code>bun install
bun --filter @goshikq/sdk test</code></pre>
    <h2>Rust runtime from source</h2>
    <pre class="install"><code>cargo run -p goshikq-server
# or: cargo build -p goshikq-server --release</code></pre>
    <h2>Docker</h2>
    <p>Compose file: <code>docker-compose.yml</code>. Postgres, runtime, and Studio images exist in tree. Production must not use <code>GOSHIKQ_AUTH_MODE=none</code>. A published image registry is not claimed.</p>
    <pre class="install"><code>docker compose up -d postgres</code></pre>
    <p>Without Docker: <code>DATABASE_URL=embedded</code>.</p>
  </section>
</Marketing>
